      on one (1) computer in Client's workplace. Under a Computer-Based
      License, while all of the SOFTWARE must be installed and used on the
      same computer, there is no limitation on the number of Client's
      employees that may access and use the SOFTWARE on such computer;
      provided, however, that the SOFTWARE may not be run concurrently (i.e.,
      only one instance of the SOFTWARE can be launched on one computer at a
      time).

   C. Evaluation License: Pre-Release Software. If you have acquired an
