      that is valid and enforceable and that comes closest to expressing the
      intention of replaced term, and this EULA shall be enforceable as so
      modified. However, in the event that such court declines to modify such
      provisions, then the parties will in good faith negotiate a modification
      to the provision to the minimum extent necessary to render it valid and
      enforceable in conformity with the parties' intent as manifested herein.

